        "policy": "Income - Salaried, Hourly, Contract, Part-Time, Bonus or Casual",
        "description": "### Simplified Income Documentation\r\n\r\nFor clients with income taxed at source, the following documentation is required:\r\n\r\n* **Salaried employment:** A Letter of Employment and a recent pay stub are required to verify income.\r\n* **Hourly, contract, or commission employment:** Eligibility and documentation requirements may vary. Discuss the file with your Underwriter or Business Development Manager for guidance, including when a two-year history may be required to support uneven hours or overtime.\r\n\r\nFor additional support, contact your Underwriter or Business Development Manager through the Bridgewater Broker Portal.",
