        "description": "**Gateway Alternative Mortgage Program**\r\n\r\n**Owner Occupied Properties with Rental Suite**\r\n* Rental income confirmed via market rents or T1 Generals\r\n\r\n**Subject Rental/Investment Properties**\r\n* Rental income confirmed via market rents or T1 Generals.\r\n\r\n* Other options are available, discuss with your underwriter or business development manager before submitting. Find your Underwriter or BDM at https://bwbbrokerinfo.ca/contact-us/.\r\n\r\n* Completion of a rental worksheet is required. This can be found at https://bwbbrokerinfo.ca/broker-resources/",
