        "description": "- Beacon minimum is 600. **We will consider lower credit scores, please ask your BDM** \r\n- Terms: \r\n   - 1, 2 and 3 year fixed rate (up to 30 year amortization) \r\n   - 5 year variable (up to 25 year amortization)\r\n- Min & Max loan amount: \r\n    - Minimum: \r\n       - $100,000\r\n       - $75,000 in Atlantic Canada\r\n    - Maximum\r\n       - $750,000\r\n- Fixed and VRM terms apply \r\n- Eligible properties:  Single Family Detached, Semi-Detached, Duplex, Single Unit Condominiums/ Apartments, Recreational \r\n- Purchase & Refinance eligibility\r\n- Home occupied by an immediate family member or intended use of the borrower is for 50% year round occupancy\r\n- Location parameters: 30,000 minimum population base or 50 km's from GVA or GTA\r\n- Down payment: Minimum 20% for purchases\r\n- Prepayments\r\n    - Early payouts permitted (may be subject to charges)\r\n    - Opportunity to make an annual payment up to 20% of original mortgage amount, double-up payments or increase monthly payment up to 20% at any time\r\n    - Prepayment charge is calculated as the greater of 3 months interest or the interest rate differential (using National Bank - Optimum Mortgage posted rate, not bond rate) plus 1% of the mortgage balance\r\n    - Mortgage is portable based on client and property qualification\r\n    - Blend & extend options available\r\n\r\n**Outside our lending guidelines**\r\n- BEACON/FICO scores less than 500\r\n- Unique properties\r\n- Previous grow-ops\r\n- Rent-to-own contracts\r\n- Farms\r\n- Mobile homes and/or manufactured homes\r\n- Rental pools\r\n- Cooperative housing\r\n- Indigenous reserve land\r\n- AirBNB.",
