        "id": 1412,
        "policy": "Amortization",
        "description": "**30 Years** \r\n* Standard, Multi-Purpose\r\n* Conventional Owner Occupied\r\n* High Ratio: Maximum 30 years\r\n        * Borrower needed to be one of those requirements: First-time home buyer **OR** Buying a new build\r\n\r\n**25 Years**\r\n* Standard, Multi-Purpose \r\n* Insured.",
