        "id": 6116,
        "policy": "Income - Investments",
        "description": "* For applicants that earn investment/RRIF income. Here is what is required for qualification purposes:\r\n* The latest T1 General supported by an NOA; and\r\n* Applicable investment statement(s) to show that the borrower has sufficient invested assets to\r\nsupport the indicated income (reasonability). \r\n* The investment statement must be in the borrower\u2019s name and should identify the investment company, account number, balances and\r\nbe dated within 60 days of the application\r\n* Outstanding taxes > $2,000 must be confirmed paid.",
        "isAccepted": 1
