        "id": 7603,
        "policy": "Income - Professionals",
        "description": "**Medical Professionals DESCRIPTION**\r\n* Physicians \u2013 Insured mortgage solution for borrowers who have recently completed their residency/fellowship within the last 24 months or are currently completing their residency/fellowship.\r\n* Dentists & Veterinarians \u2013 Insured mortgage solution for borrowers who have recently completed their residency/fellowship or are in the final year of a recognized program or residency/fellowship in Canada\r\n.\r\n\r\n**ADVANTAGES**\r\n* Up to 95% financing for purchases.\r\n* Access to 5-year fixed and adjustable mortgage terms.\r\n* Borrowers may qualify based on projected future income, depending on their current stage of practice or education\r\n\r\n**Loan Details** \r\n* Loan Purpose: Purchases, Switches, Collateral Transfers\r\n* Maximum LTV: 95%\r\n* Minimum Loan Amount: $50,000\r\n* Maximum Property Value:\r\n* Property value must be less than $1,500,000 (Insured)\r\n* Property value must be less than $1,000,000 (Insurable)\r\n\r\n**Term**\r\n* Fixed: 5 Years\r\n* Adjustable: 5 Years\r\n\r\n**Amortization**\r\n* Maximum 25 years (Insured and Insurable)\r\n* Maximum 30 years for First-Time Home Buyers and New Construction (Insured only)\r\n\r\n**Rate Guarantee**\r\n* 120 days\r\n\r\n**Down Payment**\r\n\r\n* Minimum 5% total down payment required.\r\n* A minimum of 5% must come from the borrower\u2019s own resources, including gifted funds.\r\n* The remaining 5% may be borrowed\r\n\r\n**Borrower Qualifications**\r\n* Physicians\r\n* Enrolled or registered in a recognized medical residency/fellowship in Canada.\r\n* Newly practicing physicians who began practicing within the last 24 months.\r\n* Foreign-trained physicians must:\r\n* Have completed their program within 24 months or\r\n* Be licensed by a provincial college, and be a Canadian Citizen or Permanent Resident\r\n.* Dentists & Veterinarians\r\n* In final year of residency/fellowship or enrolled in a recognized Canadian program.\r\n* Newly practicing:\r\n* Dentists: must have completed training within the last 24 months.\r\n* Veterinarians: must have completed training within the last 12 months\r\n.",
        "isAccepted": 1
