        "description": "**Documentation Required**\r\n\r\n* Confirmed by current signed lease agreement supported by a T1 General with Statement of Real Estate Rentals and the corresponding NOA\r\n*  If the subject is a rental and there are one or more non-subject rentals, income is evaluated using a rental income analysis and must meet a minimum combined Debt Service Coverage Ratio (DSCR) of 1.2. The subject property will be factored into this analysis to ensure all properties meet the combined DSCR of 1.2\r\n* For the subject \u2013 you must use 50% of rental income and 100% of PITH in ratios \r\n* If the subject property is an owner occupied property (including owner occupied properties with rental income) and there is only one non-subject rental, we will add 50% of the rental income to the gross income \r\n* If the subject property is an owner occupied property (including owner occupied properties with rental income) we will still use 50% for the subject and if there two or more non-subject rentals, we will evaluate using the rental income analysis",
