        "policy": "Income - Salaried, Hourly, Contract, Part-Time, Bonus or Casual",
        "description": "**Salaried, Hourly Paid FT or Hourly Paid PT**\r\n\r\n**Income Verification** ***One of:***\r\n- Current Paystub with YTD earnings within 30 days\r\n- Direct Deposit to FW for the last 90 days grossed up by 30%\r\n- Employment letter on letterhead, dated within 30 days stating current & YTD earnings.\r\n\r\n**AND**\r\n**Sustainability Verification** ***One of:***\r\n- 2 years most recent NOA*\r\n- 2 years most recent T4\r\n\r\n_Current Paystubs are required if Bonus/Profit Sharing/ is included in employment income as well as 2 years most recent NOA\u2019s or T4\u2019s._\r\n\r\n**Commissioned Employees with Source Deduction**\r\n\r\n**Income Verification** ***One of:***\r\n- Current Paystub with YTD earnings from their employer\r\n- Employment letter on letterhead, dated within 30 days, stating current & YTD earnings.\r\n\r\n**AND**\r\n**Sustainability Verification** ***One of:***\r\n- 2 years most recent NOA (No CRA generated paystubs)\r\n- 2 years most recent T4.\r\n\r\n_Current Paystubs are required if Bonus/Profit Sharing/ is included in employment income as well as 2 years most recent NOA\u2019s or T4\u2019s._",
