        "policy": "Appraisals",
        "description": "**Alternative**\r\n\r\n* Appraisals required on all deals.\r\n\r\n**FCT\u2019s Flex Appraisal**\r\n- Home Trust will only be using FCT\u2019s Flex Appraisal product for this service. We will not be using any other appraisal products that FCT provides.\r\n- The product is applicable for properties and deals in the GVA, including Abbotsford, Aldergrove, Burnaby, Coquitlam, Delta, Langford, Langley, Lions Bay, Maple Ridge, Mission, New Westminster, North Vancouver, Pitt Meadows, Port Coquitlam, Port Moody, Richmond, Saanich, Squamish, Surrey, Vancouver, Victoria, West Vancouver and White Rock.\r\n- Properties held in a holding company or operating company, new construction properties or commercial properties are not eligible for this product.\r\n\r\n**Accelerator**\r\n\r\n* Typically confirmed by insurer; if Home Trust requires a full appraisal, it is completed through the broker.",
