        "policy": "Income - Pension/Retirement",
        "description": "* T4A Slips are acceptable to confirm OAS and CPP. For other, sources below are acceptable\r\n* Current Pay Stub Showing Gross Income\r\n* Current Letter from the Organization providing the pension income\r\n* Current Direct Pay Deposits 3 months bank statements supporting \r\n* NOA from most recent 2 years (Will have to be accompanied with above to show the income stream continues)\"",
