        "description": "**NON SUBJECT PROPERTY**\r\n\r\n**Acceptable Documentation**\r\n* Either of the following is acceptable\r\n* Lease Agreement showing the gross rental income from all units supported by a full T1 General including the Statement of Real Estate Rentals and NOA is required.\r\n* In cases where the client has not owned the rental for a year the lease agreement can be supported by one of the following. Copies of the last 3 month rental cancelled cheques or evidence that it has been deposited for the last 3 months.\r\n* If the lease agreement is expired then one of the two items mentioned above or signed tenant acknowledgement confirming current occupancy and rent\r\n\r\n**Qualification**\r\n* We use 50% added to income on a legal suite and if they have more then one rental we use the TD rental worksheet, can\u2019t add any surplus to income though.",
