        "id": 1849,
        "policy": "Income - BFS Confirmed",
        "description": "Income can be verified in as little as 4 steps:\r\n* Verification of cash flow and business continuance via most recent 3-6 months of business bank\r\nstatements\r\n* Recent invoices or contracts substantiating business continuance and declared income\r\n* Fully completed income declaration letter - Further documentation may be requested\r\n\r\nProof of business ownership and existence via one of the following:\r\n* Articles of Inc.\r\n* Business License/Registration\r\n* Business Bank Account Reference Letter\r\n* Trade License\r\n* GST Registrations/Returns\r\n* Liability Insurance Certificate.",
        "isAccepted": 1
