        "description": "**Private Pension**\r\n\r\n* Income to be verified with two of the following:\r\n* Most recent Notice of Assessment NOA\r\n* Recent bank statements showing 3 months of pension deposits\r\n* Current pension statement\r\n* Most recent T4A\r\n* Letter from pension administrator confirming the amount\r\n\r\n**Public Pension**\r\n* Income to be verified with one or more of the following:\r\n* Recent bank statements showing 3 months of regular deposits\r\n* Recent pension statement\r\n* Most recent T4A\r\n\r\n**Retirement**\r\n* The most recent annuity/RIF/LIF statement to confirm sufficient investments to last the full term of the mortgage\r\n* The most recent direct deposit payment or payment stub (dated\r\nwithin the last year); OR\r\n* The most recent T1 Generals; OR\r\n* T4As; AND\r\n* The most recent years Notice of Assessment NOA",
