        "description": "* If net income is declared on line 13900, see BFS -Confirmed \r\n* If net income is not declared on line 1390, require 2 year NOA and the applicable T1 General for each NOA and a paystub/notification of direct deposit or letter of employment\r\n* Amount eligible for qualification purposes is the lower of the two year average or the amount for the most recent tax year\r\n* Example Year 1 NOA is 75,000\r\n* Example Year 2 NOA is 50,000\r\n* Eligible Income for qualification is 62,500.",
