        "policy": "Rentals - General Information",
        "description": "**Eligible Properties**\r\n\r\n* Existing or new (completion only) properties with a maximum of 4 units. Standard property criteria apply.\r\n\r\n**Excluded Property Types**\r\n\r\n* Properties with a commercial component\r\n* Time-share ownership interests\r\n* Secondary or vacation homes\r\n* Rooming houses\r\n* Quarter interest or shared interest ownership\r\n* Properties that are part of rental pool arrangements\r\n* Properties in Fort McMurray, AB\r\n* Properties within a 100 km radius of Fort McMurray\r\n* Mobile homes\r\n* On Reserve properties\r\n\r\n**Eligible Loan Purposes**\r\n\r\n* Purchase\r\n* Switch\r\n* Refinance\r\n\r\n**Note**\r\n\r\n* Property is deemed rental when a client uses it as a secondary/vacation home but any part of it is rented.\r\n* We do not lend to professional landlords.\r\n\r\n**Minimum Beacon**\r\n\r\n* 621",
