        "policy": "Income - BFS Stated (Sagen & CG Program)",
        "description": "**Loan Purpose**\r\n- An ideal mortgage solution for self-employed borrowers who are unable to qualify via traditional income qualification requirements. Not CMHC applicable.\r\n\r\n**Property Type**\r\n- Owner occupied residential, 1-2 units\r\n- Secondary homes are _NOT_ eligible\r\n- Property value < $1,000,000r\r\n\r\n**LTV**\r\n- Max. 90% LTV\r\n- 65.01% to 90% LTV is a client paid premium\r\n\r\n**Loan Amount**\r\n- 95% for the first $500,000\r\n- 90% for the remaining over $500,000\r\n\r\n**Credit Requirements**\r\n- Strong credit profile is required.\r\n- Minimum two (2) trade lines with at least two (2) year history\r\n- No mortgage, installment or revolving credit delinquencies within the last 12 months\r\n- No mortgage defaults for the past 5-7 years (depending on the insurer)\r\n- No previous bankruptcy\r\n\r\n**Borrower Qualification*\r\n- The borrower\u2019s income must be reasonable for the nature and tenure of the business and must align with the credit profile and current financial position of the borrower. For higher incomes, additional information and/or documentation may be requested.\r\n    - Self-employed for a minimum of 2 years\r\n    - Commission sales income is not eligible under this program\r\n    - No income tax arrears\r\n    - Self-employed borrowers must be the primary business owner\r\n    - All applicants used to qualify must occupy the property; for 2-unit properties, 1 unit must be owner-occupied\r\n    - Maximum Debt Service Ratios (DSR): GDS 39% TDS 44%\r\n\r\n**Documentation Requirements**\r\n- Documentation requirements for each self-employed borrower:\r\n    - Borrower must provide proof of self-employment for a minimum of 2 years\r\n    - Notice of Assessment from the most recent tax year at the time of application must be retained\r\n    - Strive BFS Attestation form.",
