        "policy": "Income - Salaried, Hourly, Contract, Part-Time, Bonus or Casual",
        "description": "**Required Documentation**\r\n* To qualify a borrower using salaried income, the following documents are required:\r\n* Letter of Employment\r\n* Must confirm:\r\n* Job title\r\n* Start date\r\n* Status (full-time, permanent)\r\n* Base salary\r\n* Most Recent Pay Stub\r\n* Most Recent 2 Years of:\r\n* T1 Generals\r\n* T4s\r\n* Notices of Assessment (NOAs).",
