        "id": 1344,
        "policy": "Income - Investments",
        "description": "## Investment Income \u2013 Manulife Bank\r\n\r\n### Eligibility Requirements\r\n\r\n* Investment income from registered investments (RRSPs) is excluded for borrowers under 50 years of age.\r\n* For borrowers aged 50 and older, eligible RRSP income is limited to income reported on Line 12900 of the T1 General or on T4RSP slips.\r\n* Statement of RRIF income may be provided where applicable.\r\n* Non-RRSP investment income may be considered where supported by:\r\n\r\n  * A copy of a recent investment portfolio statement (no older than 30 days from the application date); and\r\n  * Two years of investment income reported on tax documentation.\r\n* Investment income is only eligible for applications with an LTV of 80% or less.\r\n* RESPs are excluded from the investment income calculation.\r\n\r\n### Income Verification\r\n\r\nProvide one of the following:\r\n\r\n* Two most recent years' T1 Generals and the second most recent Notice of Assessment; or\r\n* Two most recent years' T5 slips; or\r\n* Two most recent years' T4RIF slips.\r\n\r\n### Business Rules\r\n\r\n* Investment income is treated as variable income.",
