        "id": 1345,
        "policy": "Income - Maternity or Parental Leave",
        "description": "## Maternity or Parental Leave Income \u2013 Manulife Bank\r\n\r\n### Eligibility Requirements\r\n\r\nA letter from the employer is required confirming:\r\n\r\n* The expected return-to-work date; and\r\n* The income level upon return.\r\n\r\n### Income Determination\r\n\r\nIf there is no set return-to-work date, use:\r\n\r\n* 60% of the borrower's previously earned income for qualification purposes.\r\n\r\n### Income Verification\r\n\r\nProvide evidence of current leave income through:\r\n\r\n* Bank deposits confirming Employment Insurance (EI) benefits and employer top-ups; or\r\n* Other official receipts confirming EI benefits and employer top-ups.\r\n\r\n### Income Treatment\r\n\r\n* Maternity and Parental Leave income is treated as a fixed income source.\r\n* Income is not subject to averaging.",
