        "description": "**Manulife Bank Select \u2013 Healthcare Professional Program**\r\n\r\n**Eligible Clients**\r\n* To qualify, clients must be:\r\n* A Resident Doctor enrolled in a recognized residency program in Canada.\r\n* A Dentist or Veterinarian:\r\n* In the last year of a recognized residency, or\r\n* Newly practicing (within 12 months of graduation from an accredited Canadian program).\r\n* A Physician who graduated from an accredited Canadian program within the past 24 months.\r\n* Must also be for an owner-occupied principal residence.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Income used for qualification varies by profession and stage:**\r\n\r\n* Medical Resident (1st or 2nd year): $200,000\r\n* Family Medicine/3rd+ year Resident: $280,000\r\n* Newly Practicing Physician: Based on specialty \u2014 ranges from:\r\n* $280,000 (Family Medicine)\r\n* Up to $791,000 (Ophthalmology)\r\n* Dentists (final year or <12 months practice): $110,000\r\n* Veterinarians (final year or <12 months practice): $105,000\r\n\r\n**LTV**\r\n* Up to 90% \r\n\r\n**Beacon. Score**\r\n\r\n* All provinces plus the following cities in Quebec: Montreal, Quebec City, and Gatineau\r\n* Primary applicant: 650\r\n* Quebec (except for Montreal, Quebec City, and Gatineau)\r\n* Primary applicant: 680\r\n\r\n**Required Documentation**\r\n\r\n* Residents: Proof of enrollment, specialty, and current year.\r\n* Newly Practicing Physicians: Proof of program completion, specialty, and graduation date.\r\n* Must include all documents required under standard program guideline\r\n\r\n**Athletes**\r\n* Considered salaried.\r\n* Must provide athletic contract detailing income and term",
