        "description": "# Eligible Communities \u2013 Investment Program\r\n\r\nThe following communities are eligible for Manulife Bank's Investment Program.\r\n\r\n### British Columbia\r\n\r\nAbbotsford, Chilliwack, Courtenay, Cranbrook, Kamloops, Kelowna, Mission, Nanaimo, North Cowichan, Parksville, Penticton, Prince George, Prince Rupert, Salmon Arm, Squamish, Terrace, Vernon, Victoria, Williams Lake, and the Greater Vancouver Area (GVA).\r\n\r\n### Alberta\r\n\r\nCalgary, Edmonton, Fort McMurray, Grande Prairie, Lethbridge, Medicine Hat, Red Deer.\r\n\r\n### Saskatchewan\r\n\r\nPrince Albert, Regina, Saskatoon.\r\n\r\n### Manitoba\r\n\r\nBrandon, Selkirk, Steinbach, Winnipeg.\r\n\r\n### Ontario\r\n\r\nBarrie, Belleville, Bracebridge, Brantford, Brockville, Cambridge, Centre Wellington, Chatham-Kent, Cobourg, Collingwood, Cornwall, Elliot Lake, Essa, Gravenhurst, Guelph, Hamilton, Hawkesbury, Huntsville, Innisfil, Kawartha Lakes, Kemptville, Kenora, Kingston, Kitchener, Leamington, London, Midland, Nanticoke, Niagara Falls, Norfolk, North Bay, Orillia, Oro-Medonte, Oshawa, Ottawa, Owen Sound, Pembroke, Petawawa, Peterborough, Port Hope, Sarnia, Sault Ste. Marie, Simcoe, Springwater, St. Catharines, Stoney Creek, Stayner, Stratford, Sudbury, Thunder Bay, Tilsonburg, Timmins, Wasaga Beach, Waterloo, Windsor, Woodstock, and the Greater Toronto Area (GTA).\r\n\r\n### Quebec\r\n\r\nAlma, Baie-Comeau, Drummondville, Gatineau, Granby, Joliette, Montreal Island, Qu\u00e9bec City, Rimouski, Rivi\u00e8re-du-Loup, Rouyn-Noranda, Saguenay, Saint-Georges, Saint-Hyacinthe, Saint-Jean-sur-Richelieu, Salaberry-de-Valleyfield, Sept-\u00celes, Shawinigan, Sherbrooke, Sorel-Tracy, Thetford Mines, Trois-Rivi\u00e8res, Val-d'Or, and Victoriaville.\r\n\r\n### Nova Scotia\r\n\r\nCape Breton, Halifax, New Glasgow, Sydney, Truro.\r\n\r\n### New Brunswick\r\n\r\nBathurst, Fredericton, Moncton, Saint John.\r\n\r\n### Prince Edward Island\r\n\r\nCharlottetown, Summerside.\r\n\r\n### Newfoundland and Labrador\r\n\r\nCorner Brook, St. John's.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Prohibited Property Locations\r\n\r\nThe following property locations are ineligible:\r\n\r\n* Houses on Native Land, leased land, or parkland.\r\n* Properties located in the Territories (Yukon, Northwest Territories, Nunavut), Inuit Territory, Northern Villages, Nisga'a lands, Cree, or Naskapi Villages.\r\n* Company-owned or company-related housing in designated Single Resource Industry Communities, including:\r\n\r\n  * **Quebec:** Murdochville\r\n  * **Ontario:** Marathon, Manitouwadge, Red Lake\r\n  * **Alberta:** Grande Cache, Fox Creek, Swan Hills\r\n  * **British Columbia:** Logan Lake, Stewart, Tumbler Ridge",
