        "id": 639,
        "policy": "Income - Salaried, Hourly, Contract, Part-Time, Bonus or Casual",
        "description": "**Salary, Hourly with Guaranteed Hours (including Part-Time)**\r\n* 100% of salary or base hourly income (guaranteed hours with a standard work week and not subject to lay-offs) can be used.\r\n\r\nDocumentation Requirements - Letter of employment supported by one of the following:\r\n* Most recent paystub\r\n* 2 months history of current direct salary deposits \r\n\r\nIn cases where the borrower has less than 1 year employment tenure, the previous year T4 is required.\r\n\r\n**Overtime**   \r\n* Less than or equal to 25% of qualifying income\r\n* may be used for qualification purposes provided the income has been received consistently for 2 years.\r\n\r\n**Bonus Income, Hours Not Guaranteed(including Part-time) & Contract**\r\n* may be used for qualification purposes provided the income has been received consistently for 2 years.\r\n\r\n**Documentation Requirements for Overtime, Bonus, Hours Not Guaranteed(including Part-time) & Contract**\r\n\r\n2 Year Average\r\n* Letter of employment supported by the following:\r\n* Most recent paystub OR 3 months history of direct deposits\r\n* Most recent 2 years T4s or NOAs\r\n* Year end paystub where most recent years T4 is not yet available\r\n\r\nMost recent 24 month average:\r\n* In addition to the above, YTD paystubs or history of direct deposits confirming income for the most recent 24 month period to be provided\r\n\r\n**Letter of Employment (LOE)**\r\n\r\nTo be on company letterhead with address and phone number and include all of the elements listed below. Verbal confirmation is conducted.\r\n* Author\u2019s name, title & signature (someone of authority - i.e. Immediate Manager, HR department, Owner)\r\n* Dated within 60 days of application date\r\n* Full First and Last name of employee\r\n* Annual Base Salary or Hourly rate\r\n* Length of Employment (Start Date)\r\n* Position\r\n* Status (full time, part time, contract, etc.)\r\n* Prospect for continued employment\r\n \r\n**Paystubs**\r\n* Dated no more than 30 days prior of the application date\r\n\r\n**Pending Increases**\r\n* Must be confirmed by the employer in writing prior to funding\r\n\r\n**T1 Generals**\r\n* Cannot be used in isolation, must be supported by the corresponding NOA\r\n\r\n**Income Streams**\r\n* Maximum number of income stream (sources) used to qualify is limited to 4\r\n\r\n**Family Business**\r\n* Income used must be 2 year average.\r\n* Documentation Requirements\r\n* Letter of employment\r\n* Most recent 2 years NOAs (using a 2 year average of income shown on line 150).\r\n\r\n**Variable Income:** \r\n- If income is increasing year over year, the most recent 24 month average can be used \u2013 great option for borrowers who income was affected by COVID and has been increasing in 2022 and 2023! \r\n- Insured/Insurable: if there was a decline in income the prior year: if current YTD income docs supports we can use the 2 year average.",
