        "id": 503,
        "policy": "Income - Pension/Retirement",
        "description": "**Taxable Pension**\r\n\r\n* All pensions are to be permanent income.  \r\n* The following are acceptable pension types:\r\n* Public: Federal and or Provincial programs (i.e. CPP, QPP, OAS)\r\n* Employer: Canadian Company or Government Employee pension\r\n* Foreign: Foreign pensions that are paid into a Canadian bank account and income is declared and taxed in Canada\r\n\r\n**Documentation Requirements**\r\n* The amount of pension income being used is to be reasonable and verified as follows:\r\n* Public (CPP, QPP, OAS): ONE of the following confirming pension income:\r\n\r\n**Most recent T4A slip(s)**\r\n* Most recent NOA\r\n* Recent pension stub dated within 30 days or 3 months bank statements showing direct deposit\r\n* Borrowers receiving OAS pension: if the applicants\u2019 income exceeds $77,580, the OAS pension is subject to claw back therefore current/ongoing eligibility verification is required if being used to qualify.\r\n* Employer: Any TWO of the following confirming pension income:\r\n* Recent pension stub dated within 30 days or 3 months bank statements showing direct deposit\r\n* Most recent T4A\r\n* Most recent NOA\r\n* A letter from the previous employer/pension administrator confirming the pension amount\r\n* Foreign:\r\n* Recent pension stub dated within 30 days or 3 months bank statements showing direct deposit, as well as the most recent 2 years NOAs supported by the T1 Generals\r\n\r\n\r\n**Other Taxable Pensions**\r\n* A letter from the organization providing the pension income supported by a current pay stub showing deductions, dated within 30 days OR Most recent 2 years T4As or NOA\u2019s (NOAs must be supported by a current * pay stub, direct pay deposit or letter from the organization providing the pension to confirm that the income stream continues to be received)\r\n\r\n**NonTaxable Pensions**\r\n* A letter from the organization providing the pension income supported by a current pay stub, dated within 30 days showing gross income OR\r\n* Most recent 2 years T4A\u2019s or NOA\u2019s AND A current pay stub, dated within 30 days showing gross income to confirm that the income stream continues to be received\r\n* T1 Generals cannot be used unless accompanied by corresponding NOA\u2019s (using 2 year average shown on line 150) and may be requested where borrower has multiple sources of income.",
        "isAccepted": 1
