        "id": 280,
        "policy": "Credit History: Bruised credit, consumer proposals, bankruptcy",
        "description": "**Credit Description for RMG client**\r\n* Minimum 2-active trade lines, with 24-months reporting\r\n* Consideration may be made on 1-active trade provided\r\n12-months history reporting R1/I1/O1 or Addition of strong\r\nqualifying co-borrower or guarantor meeting all standard\r\nCredit requirements.\r\n* Minimum 1-trade line with Financial Institution\r\n* Minimum $1000 limit for revolving accounts,\r\nor $2500 original loan amount\r\n* Credit dormant for less than 12-months may be considered\r\n\r\n**Bankruptcy Requirements**\r\n* RMG will not consider past bankrupt clients for Refinance\r\ntransactions, or Second Home Purchase\r\n* For Bankruptcy clients, (We only consider them on insurable files so the purchase price must be below $1mil and amortization capped to 25 years)\r\n* Discharged minimum of 2 years\r\n* 2 years re-established credit: minimum 2 active trades with 24 months reporting \u2013 these must be new trades opened after the date of discharge.\r\n* Minimum 1 trade to be a major financial institution\r\n* Minimum $1,000 revolving limits or minimum $2,500 original loan amounts\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n**Transunion**\r\n* This is accepted by RMG but is in support of an Equifax Bureau.",
