        "id": 9107,
        "policy": "Income - BFS Enhanced",
        "description": "BFS less than 2yrs - Designed to help previously employed new business owners obtain mortgage financing to Purchase a home or Transfer their existing mortgage. (High Ratio & Insurable loans ONLY).\r\n\r\n**Purpose**\r\n- Purchase, Port and Replacements\r\n- Purchase Plus Improvements\r\n- Standard & Collateral Transfers\r\n\r\n**RMG Products**\r\n- RMG Low Rate Basic\r\n- RMG 1 \u2013 5yr Standard Fixed\r\n- RMG 5yr Standard ARM (login to Gateway for full product details & requirements)\r\n\r\n**Borrower Eligibility**\r\n- Borrower(s) operating a registered business less than 2yrs\r\n- Credit score: minimum 650 or greater for the BFS borrower\r\n\r\n**Qualifying Income**\r\n- Based on the lesser of last 2 year average OR most recent year\u2019s BFS confirmed income\r\n- Add Backs and 15% Gross-ups will only be considered for Sole Proprietors or Partnerships ( Corporations / LTD not eligible for Add Backs / Gross-ups )\r\n- Retained Earnings NOT eligible as qualifying income\r\n\r\n**Documentation Requirements**\r\n- 2 years of income confirmation is required by way of prior years\u2019 T4s demonstrating previous income and employment history AND/OR Self-employed income documented as follows:\r\n   \r\n**Sole Proprietor / Partnership:**\r\n   - Confirmation of BFS income\r\n   -  Most recent T1 Generals with Statement of Business Activities\r\n   -  Corresponding NOA\r\n\r\n**Corporation / LTD:**\r\n   - One of the following as confirmation of business ownership\r\n      - Business/Corporate search\r\n      - Articles of Incorporation\r\n   -  Most recent year T1 General\r\n   - Corresponding NOA\r\n   -  One of the following as confirmation of business income\r\n      - 1 year audited or accountant-prepared financial statements\r\n      - 1 year T2 Corporation Income Tax Returns\r\n\r\n**Loan to Value**\r\n- High Ratio and Insurable only\r\n  - Up to 95% LTV High Ratio\r\n  - Up to 80% LTV Insurable\r\n\r\n**Minimum/Maximum Loan Amounts**\r\n- Minimum:\r\n   - Standard Fixed/ARM - $45K\r\n   - Second Home - $50K\r\n   - Low Rate Basic - $75K\r\n- Maximum:\r\n   - Insurable - $799,999\r\n   -  Insured - $924,999\r\n\r\n**Property Type**\r\n- Standard property guidelines 1 - 4 units owner occupied\r\n- Maximum 1 unit for Secondary Homes\r\n\r\n**Rates**\r\n- Standard rates apply \u2013 no rate premium\r\n\r\n**Rate Buydowns**\r\n- Maximum 20 bps\r\n\r\n**Amortization**\r\n- Maximum 25 years\r\n\r\n**Appraisal Requirements**\r\n- In the case an appraisal is required, client is responsible for the appraisal cost and appraisal fee rebate program is available.\r\n- Appraisal rebate requests must be processed within 6 months of invoice date.\r\n- Must be from an approved RMG Appraiser",
