        "description": "* Economic Rent from an RMG approved appraiser where the transaction is:\r\n* Purchase of a new owner occupied property and the existing owner occupied property will be converted to a rental property and a signed lease agreement is not yet available\r\n* Purchase of a rental property under the Rental Progam",
