        "description": "* For borrowers whose income is not taxed at the source, income may now be grossed-up on a two-tiered approach:\r\n* Applicants with non-taxable income less than $30,000, are eligible to have their income grossed -up by 25 per cent\r\n* Applicants with non-taxable income greater than $30,000, are eligible to have their income grossed-up by 35 per cent.",
