        "policy": "Credit History: Bruised credit, consumer proposals, bankruptcy",
        "description": "**Purpose**\r\n- Purchase & Refinance\r\n\r\n**Occupancy**\r\n- Owner-Occupied\r\n\r\n**Max loan amount**\r\n- $1,500,000\r\n\r\n**Min credit score**\r\n- 500\r\n\r\n**GDS & TDS**\r\n- 45% & 50%\r\n\r\n**Qualifying rate**\r\n- Greater if BoC 5 year or Contract + 2%\r\n\r\n**Max LTV**\r\n- 65%\r\n\r\n**Location**\r\n- GTA, Major Urban, Urban, Rural\r\n\r\n**Min Sq Ft house & Condo**\r\n- 750 Sq Ft & 450 Sq Ft\r\n\r\n**Bankruptcy**\r\n- Discharged min 2 years\r\n- CP balance may be paid out \r\n\r\n**Additional info**\r\n- Allowed additional mortgage financing \r\n- Income verification: Traditional\r\n- Max term: 5 year\r\n- Has lender's fee \r\n- Max amortization: 30 year.",
