        "id": 4622,
        "policy": "Down Payment",
        "description": "**Personal Savings, Investments and Registered Retirement Savings Plan (RRSP)**\r\n* Documentation must be provided confirming the down payment is from the borrower\u2019s own resources (without recourse to additional borrowing) and is from a legitimate source.\r\n* Bank statement confirming the down payment at least 90 days prior to closing.\r\n\r\n**Sale of Property**\r\n* Documentation must be provided confirming the down payment is from the proceed of the sale of property.\r\n* Copy of a firm purchase and sale agreement for the property\r\n* Copy of the recent mortgage statement or discharge statement to confirm the current balance\r\n\r\n**Inheritance**\r\n* Documentation must be provided confirming the down payment is an inheritance from an Immediate Family Member.\r\n* A copy of the Will and a letter from the solicitor that has the amount and date when the inheritance was received\r\n* Bank statement confirming the down payment at least 15 days prior to closing\r\n\r\n**Borrowed Funds**\r\n* Documentation must be provided confirming the down payment is borrowed and is from a legitimate source.\r\n* Servicing for the loan must be included in TDS and GDS calculations.\r\n* Copy of the loan agreement\r\n* Bank statement confirming the down payment at least 15 days prior to closing",
        "isAccepted": null
