        "description": "**Owner & Non Owner Occupied rental income (Existing)**\r\n* Obtain 2 of the following:\r\n* Signed Lease Agreement along with copy of First and Last Cheque deposit\r\n* An appraisal which outlines a reasonable market rent\r\n* T1 General with Rental Schedule + NOA\r\n* Bank Statements demonstrating receipt of rental income\r\n\r\n**Owner Occupied or Non-Owner Occupied (New)**\r\n* Obtain the following:\r\n\u2022 An appraisal which outlines a reasonable market rent \r\n* Assignment of rents signed by the borrower\r\n\r\n**Calculation**\r\n* Owner-Occupied Rental Income\r\n* 50% Added to Income (No averaging is required)\r\n* Up to 50% of gross monthly income x 12 \u2022 Up to 50% of gross annual income\r\n* Non-Owner Occupied Rental Income\r\n* Rental Worksheet Required (no averaging required)\r\n* Up to 90% of monthly income x 12\r\n* Up to 90% of gross annual income\r\n* Deductions to be included to determine if there is a deficit or income: \r\n* 10% Vacancy Allowance\r\n* Mortgage Payment\r\n* Taxes\r\n * Heat\r\n* Insurance\r\n* 100% of Condo Fees\r\n* 90% Rental Offset for Rental Income\r\n* Non-Subject Property\r\n* 50% addback for Subject Rental.",
